{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_06",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fdb3fe96382f9a5c6c3821ccb9243461535d52b3942b736574f6101978fd72f2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a779d6067233159a514d90c660cb0def0c6096638375bb455bdacf4d32947a04",
      "text": "letter from Cafe Parade",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70b80d750494ac5813c360a36ef092c1c37fdfa89f4154f6d3a8deb010225753",
      "text": "Cafe Parade收到了第一封粉丝信。\n被信件内容深深感动的5人，希望能将“谢谢”的心情\n回馈给粉丝，于是找制作人商量。\n随之提出了举办感谢祭的提案……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000027:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:010eb00a2742ee87f352d94f38fb9c43e26548a2aea7d644d19daab1f3b3e4bc",
      "text": "第6话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000027:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a779d6067233159a514d90c660cb0def0c6096638375bb455bdacf4d32947a04",
      "text": "letter from Cafe Parade",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3aa3e647b4e955053ee4e29957a7172462038e0900c3c37135dffcc8527fb04",
      "text": "制作人，辛苦了。听说有寄给我们的\n粉丝信送达，我就立刻赶过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dde12cd903449be4a417d4c0f0a97df0718d4adabb7a7a4899fbff0f5d299b47",
      "text": "大家来得正好。\n我刚才正在整理呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10676399f1979296e2a41a40efec284e55cfd916200784f31386d6ce4302f42b",
      "text": "哇……这些全都是写给我们的\n信件对吧！嘿嘿，好开心啊～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d945e4978c7ae64a534cef4579203768a06024afba4ecd979ac1fe6e72aeded",
      "text": "嗯，我也非常期待阅读呢！\n……话说，阿斯兰先生，你怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f53947cc8ea0a9d1dc11fa77be63d82e2b74805e6cfb3fc9bc918d67dd4c5079",
      "text": "……竟然有如此之多\n写有吾之真名的密函送达。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:594ae8fe7342e177cb40fcbb2f581f7abcad6da8deb21a875e296958fc1f968d",
      "text": "那么，便来解开封印吧！\n唔……写了些什么……竟然！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53ec4c4994c0716e1021a0ef22b78935ecc51d350faf9ef60ba35d5f2e3565a1",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈！实在太美妙了！\n吾将赐予此人撒旦的祝福！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37f0d45bfded1c3bbeeec8ab18cf3fd86ee2f71c60552733766f2101789b314c",
      "text": "呵呵，太好了呢。那么，\n粉丝信里写了些什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17d80123496f7813c298e7f947899bfb7ceb5d5a7aafa369086491a8d9e8859d",
      "text": "嗯。说是作为暗之使者歌唱、起舞的\n吾之身姿，给予了其勇气，拯救了其心灵……信中是这般写的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1105ef842d80cb20f329c48d3e6a732803fa1dd7c2f2e381d02f4a91cd8ee580",
      "text": "明明反倒是我们被那些话语所拯救了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2446fa71678f3f3dea2bc6cd43e90858ea79e2ce361db1706f82cf465549d560",
      "text": "最近315 Pro的工作也变多了，大家在电视、\n在杂志等各种领域进行挑战……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80929e02012781bdd17064418b087ca146c5ac0bf2c12e06e61e350a863ac058",
      "text": "无论遇到什么都能努力坚持下去，\n都是多亏了这样的支持啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_a:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0805762415265d309292880610dac056397c66afc6bf1d5c4035d5cd8a0bee57",
      "text": "确实呢……好想向粉丝们\n传达“谢谢”的心情啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b10d3b554c6504e3c006669298ca8543be07830eca92c2b98495e51dbdf6ab6",
      "text": "吾、吾也想向仆从们传达感谢！\n吾主啊，吾等难道就没有什么能做的吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:990615a049fe42dde1d7f24f2eee670d0554bdf3ebf6d90b1dfb803ef043aed5",
      "text": "既然如此……举办一场“感谢祭”，\n邀请各位粉丝前来如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab5ab7ac3fa8fa35d87b545e58e4da821702cba579b087db81b7355db69b161c",
      "text": "这个提议真不错！我想向来到活动的\n各位粉丝，当面表达感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dc7ba2441d952fcfc9c7f89f6b5bb98a68ccf57caa6908e1d9f427b59632b1e",
      "text": "我也赞成！\n真希望能用最棒的款待来迎接大家啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab46ff13c0df5a85a49c82ff829b40b42f210caea3309840e92e9fa124566b0a",
      "text": "既然如此，我想制作当天限定的甜品\n招待大家呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab988710b68d4d5d7b084664e3743d993c2b4dd5998fb09d10c69657ad5c615a",
      "text": "那么吾也要翻阅精炼术的教典，\n炼制出崭新的口粮！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b2d71f13443deccf787c688e638c5c0922ff9252a608d1ccb2aedcf8307384e",
      "text": "好——！我也想办Live！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2ceb9653a3b0573fa42fcae6caa049dcc34663feb671dd34ab90c32cb17e576",
      "text": "因为我想告诉大家，多亏了大家的支持，\n我才能把唱歌和跳舞努力练得这么棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e4666a2c0ed0a2911486304ce4589c969ccc6698b0e9d1769e4351a862f2e1a",
      "text": "刚才说的这些，我们全都办吧。\n办一场以“款待”为主题的感谢祭！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85452dff0733225335769ae47b9083a66a28f813892e18e9b09eb7d030894b15",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー！\n办一场能让大家尽兴的活动吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1e73ae589f57a2cd7bf1084e67325702c786c5c6695901b60af4b15ee4759b9",
      "text": "库库库……为了仆从们，\n如今正是解放吾体内隐藏的所有力量之时！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5fcef601af8226660f20c9817e310fd26ae6878dc925ac3bbf0535f8ea3231c",
      "text": "近期我们来定下详细方案吧。我会联系大家，\n各位也先整理一下各自的想法哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000162:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000169:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a0283ae8db0c366b12108b8f63dd123433d45bb798afa554fec2b5b451f40d0",
      "text": "刚才想把粉丝信收起来的时候，\n翻出了以前写给父母的信。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000171:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bf6d4e3d6fd539b33c485fad797d5662d78cf0a4f3928fb79f571943f62b61d",
      "text": "读了一下之后，当时的心情又涌上心头了……\n信件还真是不可思议呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000173:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20bd1318dbafab9259ed43acde3455f677288473c619119b8e18fef306937cef",
      "text": "我也写过哦！\n写给父母的信——。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000175:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fd4256559c4c183cc37f2b97ca81f13dc962cdcebe8cee113ad754ae2631c78",
      "text": "咲酱也是啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000177:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12bc2c9479beed6a838d70a4f36a7dbedda3a01155d26379364d82b83b978779",
      "text": "真巧啊。\n我以前也写过哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000179:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef94816791cdfed6c87214349f8d438c69cae7fb9afb637128259ac632b28b4d",
      "text": "因为有些无论如何都想传达的心情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000181:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f4570117abed2a5889007607a2960fc61da8fa0fa2013c84baafe41eb1a0dc",
      "text": "尔等亦是被唤醒记忆之人吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000183:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a26f05cdecb1cbb2c98045bec303cd3a3a17c2374eee014b28eedde215f99452",
      "text": "是啊，我也有写过的记忆。\n虽然已经是相当久远以前的事了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000185:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:496fcd79ab08d6b0598c73e6db7dfc04c7ad6f4a4a2d0781a5717d627cded6d4",
      "text": "诶，大家居然都一样！\n●●●●プロデューサー也给父母写过信吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000187:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e63253922a4b1991ba893d3afe77283e396f52eb2fe8e6b99c5f84251393ba0c",
      "text": "你猜呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000190:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:106423342216363c1f140a7fab295c88f521b8d06fb933a14895929b24fad79f",
      "text": "诶～不告诉我吗<emoji>image_talk_emoji_01</emoji>\n你这么一说，\n我超级在意的啊<emoji>image_talk_emoji_01</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_b:cmd-000192:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dec3bae08d56b55675e2ec934dd9e684f52376c4385b3868f94cb8717c22d72d",
      "text": "好了好了。下次有机会的话，\n再请告诉我们吧，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78f690f1140f82973fa9ca9286136fb71eb73b2c8957994f5541c0baf9cd34f1",
      "text": "（写给双亲的信……\n那确实是幼年时期的事了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdede9c9914ba3e314c78a37814ebaad258083b60ea11df824953e36b0f12292",
      "text": "（我记得是写给总是离开巢穴的双亲，\n“希望能多陪在我身边”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:608dff0eb0d1d0fa08b688138c43459e7ef731b942be46c60b502872f84710ec",
      "text": "（连我自己都觉得，小孩子还真是坦率啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7799e217a42daa44cdeeb6d461559355e689a3aa3d2b11e75b3b980597ddb2cb",
      "text": "（……真怀念啊，这封信）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:727eb84101bd26c862b5b4cac2d4af152557a333234effe4cd53e2ea11e23ad4",
      "text": "（希望能得到认可，接受我喜欢可爱的事物，\n但又没有信心能好好传达）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c86343c3433f152ef3a654a2b58a24946a24bdccd383ab0556b8ed2337df5b2",
      "text": "（烦恼了很久，才写成了信呢。\n结果最后也没能交出去就是了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000041:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97516f1255a76816e4a74d9dfe5d58cdcb71c2af6ce6b1aed1f994e2258b26eb",
      "text": "东云，你已经来了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc0a7a4075b9c739f53ced1f97df724b2b8d988e366b5c247443537bd158b380",
      "text": "嗯。我想带着烤点心去参加\n今天的感谢祭商讨会。神谷呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b35a02424d7f36e6542d98c039ecc7bd9bb333f096e82df634e9f715795cee96",
      "text": "我也是想着顺便带上调配茶，\n才顺道来这里的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2038893eb934a6a8a575ab1ac1c1ae8ad10ad5add7b54b5b6509816f7d21369",
      "text": "能遇上你真是太好了呢。\n你还没习惯去事务所的路吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da1fcbf95661a98b97c39d57d6ea3fa0628b0b9d7c4e03357a177e518b941cbf",
      "text": "前些天你也迷路了……\n点心烤好之后，我们一起过去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef6cfc79f863acb506554989f64f7265474fe4dc92bddc72c0ef984951dee862",
      "text": "不好意思啊，那就拜托你了。\n我这边准备好了也会叫你的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0982dc45aea1b362d499b8c86e33a82298727d8c09ed8f61be0f7d95ff18e3d",
      "text": "……啊，话说回来。\n前些天聊到了写给父母的信对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:034c1580e2c5dbb195c7dd308f80716b3df78eb4506d12e7c1243779dcc67cb6",
      "text": "当时稍微有点惊讶呢。\n没想到所有人都写过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41665e09533d6904c225c239c004cc69343787c0be074212637f7dac36cf8e61",
      "text": "东云写的信，我大概能猜得到哦。\n毕竟我们认识那么久了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d78f8d3900abb0c3a320f83bfa2653a837dbc1a582527e6cb398e608a461384e",
      "text": "这句话原封不动奉还给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bd51961fe761d7b79807bd0f5272d19f506d3ee220e4644c6886d2ac8ed792e",
      "text": "哈哈。直到那时之前我都忘了信的存在，\n内容却记得很清楚呢。真奇妙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d58ec17a826963f3747e426380b2a4a752b59720c166bb571227dffee747e2f9",
      "text": "……我的父母，是热衷于教育且很严厉的人对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fcc18632e54b69c8afe803366f7fa292c4e43d71159034f722edb275080f7eb",
      "text": "过去我应该也跟你发过不少牢骚，说跟向往\n自由生活的自己合不来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba7acbcdb785d3c230b5fc018b343dfb940aa8a44f0c95c0e04e0010194ce0c5",
      "text": "信里也是这么写的。\n“我想活得更自由！”这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:239d64acf4519d01e9c52657b811d31672059da0cc520851c0aef272760be550",
      "text": "但是，结果到最后也没能送出去。\n因为高中一毕业我就跑出家门了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a0ed63cc2171788ef499b98aaf47e50a3b240bd38287dca7fb563598250cebf",
      "text": "“想活得更自由”“希望你们能更多地理解我”……\n我记得尽是写了些这样的话呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7963965de1eb5893859f8a74396eaa7707a1cc6547af94b79b804dcd49295e6",
      "text": "当时的我，真的很任性又孩子气啊。\n……不，现在其实也没什么改变吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bddf9f8d75dd07726357837206eea4bb8774212321e64d91bfe74b81637f941",
      "text": "跑出家门之后，一次也没回过家……\n开起了咖啡厅，当起了偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19adbcfcab557283af47d1583703ac27d84337aa2c6d9f30938cdde54b0ee385",
      "text": "尽由着自己的性子来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98d4eacc3f9fcbd0ebf3c6ea149b9dd1f168fc40588243a4236d4e5c09fb12f5",
      "text": "……我其实也是半斤八两。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40ed35b47a136994ab27241ee499a08876aa383e205997c200b0cbc3631f8b09",
      "text": "从家里祖传的和果子店逃了出来，\n在这里一味地研究西点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:838b197e9a7ddafc4e3a510213370378fea2f898b9aef5e04fb63ea2c39e2c53",
      "text": "那封信，到底流落到哪里去了呢。\n神谷，你手头还留着吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1a0fd4c12271458af1b2debbb2e130e62aa8a0075867f35d355cbffcb2bf116",
      "text": "这个嘛，找找说不定会有……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9d463bda53daac44b7c300d9c700c3ad0b59afb29142e0332f61f678e437af8",
      "text": "果然是庄一郎吗！闻到一阵香气便下楼来\n查看……呵，果然没猜错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e241df81e5e2eada3c5721087312df44297b1afd77be410141845b78e6d454b9",
      "text": "原来是阿斯兰先生，来得正好。\n要不要和我们一起去事务所？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000093:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几个小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e87e704da87e6403439657db06e0f00966decf7a98633d2107a5ec1bb8d26ab5",
      "text": "参加感谢祭的成员，\n将是Cafe Parade和Altessimo。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acf2651c0ea1855807388abb242c24d5d3c7919f3463848229ed1a1933b79f4e",
      "text": "圭先生、丽君，请多关照。如果有服务方面\n不懂的地方，随时来问我们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcce97f0457c5a210bd10724a7ffefa894ac16ec90550980a889ae271341abb2",
      "text": "帮大忙了。\n我们对招待客人这方面不太了解……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78646bece6b990b55d95815f6d4e9b79c53b6a6ef574eeeba56f4509f560f6ac",
      "text": "毕竟至今为止，我们都是被款待的那一方呢。\nCafe Parade的各位，请多指教喽。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7eaa83bbe7c4a62206fd6e857132f0bee0aa4acad55001372f621b08e16cef9",
      "text": "因此，我们有件事想和Cafe Parade的各位商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c80dec9713cd6141d0656dd14fd3e0ee4b5e95f67a1ab00683b28e0deffefad",
      "text": "可以在幸广先生的店里，\n让我们练习一下侍应生的工作吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84bfd4b59b6e7ac4aff58ff90d633228be1621b46c2176760f8fba0a1191f670",
      "text": "不仅是为了学习待客之道，\n我认为这对培养全员的默契也是很有必要的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:944ed180fe2cc8f6d5192043b5179f00c40e324b2e5438d8f2e8dafce72808f2",
      "text": "啊，我也正想这么提议呢！\n为了让感谢祭成功，大家一起加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000181:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几个小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000188:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8c0806b97d93cbdfec927a9cf9f1d08a6cc49915f67e356c9942a41750f3bdd",
      "text": "……啊，●●●●プロデューサー。\n现在能稍微打扰一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000190:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c74295a75961dad0a7ee74d30b1499425fee4f9a3c2891003d0600ca6ce81f0d",
      "text": "听说Cafe Parade的大家\n要举办感谢祭……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000192:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35ac3b8d9a041697afec2b351896293b7dca3909d6ae903aa6ef7aefe55c37f7",
      "text": "我想着要是能稍微支持一下就好了，\n就打了这通电话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000194:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47b7284838f1466c2dbb3d0e4a51f62d81bb864a7b417f9bd341c5f885e9bce1",
      "text": "啊，我当然不是在担心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000196:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88e8014f2b5fb3a3dc60dcff866bb39b8ee9599db1ef2b9d2ea8342cbc8cfad0",
      "text": "毕竟在成为偶像之前，\n我就听说过Cafe Parade的好口碑了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000198:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ef6e9ac6eced4d265a0ca69a5c7f082ae48806c95489954067d6e3a2df0217c",
      "text": "前些天，天使酱也跟我讲过这样的话呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000200:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50c846f4b92cac1c5a8ad24f58d14ab252b3803e91d49127b134613d2a180836",
      "text": "说那是一家非常棒的咖啡厅，让人想一去\n再去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000202:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0323365bf4df2ff135df2ff8eda672ad390a08fdecf6fb41e90992ae09dc631e",
      "text": "这太令人心安了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000204:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bf3a04eec87b79561e27fd753a15ec2d2893ae54977d16d4db99a91ec772fc2",
      "text": "是啊。有这样一群人在的活动，\n一定会成功的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_e:cmd-000206:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af8c0ca72a387bc42c9588836bd2332a41acf464150af30c1d24557134788108",
      "text": "而且还有你在嘛。\n那么，今天就先聊到这里……先挂了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b7a386824945b9f47b6ccb6908341ddcd7cbde02f35119e7d63dee6da4aa669",
      "text": "……好，今天的练习就到这里！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ecdcb43b94c248d5b7ff2a74b4e63c124bf1391370d8daac85323f5ebb636f8",
      "text": "多亏了Altessimo的加入，\n感谢祭越来越有模有样了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b131a04b77643620538969e6023aeb7704f11971c7b1d43bff95b4c6c7a87586",
      "text": "是的。听取了两位的建议，\n定下了当天播放的BGM，太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca54c1ffce3a2f0547ec45505d5f9d36b7f4b547f1bf012bd520d90c2d09fae9",
      "text": "你们推荐的古典乐，真的很棒呢♪\n今天的练习也收获了好多新发现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f4516439a8e2d03ddb8c5fae9f165fcc7bdd63918d5df075b46e8f84fe4f200",
      "text": "是啊。距离正式演出还有时间。\n我们要毫不松懈地做好能做的一切准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36be327125aac8f25eb773b9b12553f491c36afbec9a879b1d01a4ad8d632dc5",
      "text": "嗯……\n还有没有其他可以准备的事情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a950b9e63a4e3100be6ef910c1169c006237c6f1af3f4363aeb340c3f9ab8521",
      "text": "……对了！下次大家一起去\n体验一下被款待的感觉如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7254915075d5a9dc34d48331871bcb34ca1ec2faeb6321baa8f13011d964fc35",
      "text": "我最近新发现了一家咖啡厅。\n说不定能像今天一样，有新的收获呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb05ab20c446d6f121d20479af9c551c26e77b391b7e018b3b9c2a9ba63a10c9",
      "text": "原来如此。重新体会一下作为接受款待的一方的\n心情，或许是个好主意呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a51ee21347e174f577c9d3e58492f160a3074271271670a1b7d52fe0385cc78",
      "text": "唔！况且是卷绪推荐的店。\n定会有美妙的指引在等待着吾等！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea6f0b75ae817e44e2bdaec06cfe63631721ec68159ba9d0c6ba72fe4e8e0f58",
      "text": "那就下次休息时一起去吧！\n那是一家服务和蛋糕都无可挑剔的店哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000135:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f08c61c15f439f57be31b2c5143de064f0f722bf1f45c48556e55a0c2c7e7024",
      "text": "感谢祭前夜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000142:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c560b3952d7e6f244ca4892e50c398e9f2dfb5bbd170d24a148410615f96679",
      "text": "……啊，辛苦了！\n其实，我有件事想跟你说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000144:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70598f3ba113b3c766bf1a3144e5279f19764f9eb8c3ffa99f209f5e46518349",
      "text": "明天不是有Cafe Parade和\nAltessimo的感谢祭吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000146:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21c8169a31505237f304f925512b18673064ae3cac06b98ad2e8e469c516f6e7",
      "text": "为了祈求正式演出大获成功，\n我给大家买了护身符哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000148:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d59886eefef1259dfe4cb0579b2aba856c209b9ccc02875f9dc3b9706ae63cb",
      "text": "是在保佑特别灵验、\n超级有名的地方买的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000150:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000152:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a47d0aa97a4ff240da67934b00a78f4fd93531f0638e12369ac02093466739",
      "text": "嘿嘿，不用客气！\n然后啊，关于那个护身符。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000154:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a03fecfa42cb5bbdb0bf2183b0db7c53097d277332c949e7375bd9a1914514d4",
      "text": "因为没能碰到●●●●プロデューサー，\n我就送到事务所去了，结果……你猜怎么着！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000156:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a1e0a3d4b36b489892d0617d8fe940279b9130e4a35f6d5955607d179c02180",
      "text": "Cafe Parade全员都在呢！托这福，\n我不光送了护身符，还当面给大家加油打气了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000158:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d66b35e8340b915798df38e165f455d9337a497f77e0ee2e0e6ab3c610747854",
      "text": "这不就是护身符立刻灵验了吗。\n太幸运了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_f:cmd-000160:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:723f3e787fae3a35c43074d5f391505344852b32878af69228d6784bde6803e7",
      "text": "……刚说完，手机快没电了！\n抱歉，今天就先到这里！明天要加油哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000035:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5a3d542846412ea239254074173503567d0c83885a7d2404feddebbaebcbb54",
      "text": "感谢祭当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecc935ccf4b6620a1e41412407b1bddbbb76f2b45f78d2d14cecbab39936c68c",
      "text": "欢迎来到感谢祭。怀揣着平日里的谢意，\n今天我也会用我的方式来招待大家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe892aa6d128272b73ab9c40c62a56e62ffcee85513c6b536f9c96276ef24039",
      "text": "这道料理好好吃……！\n请问用的是什么酱汁呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bb251168c458c6ffdb63df1f4417cc8038693e207acc41fe969470fe8e5d624",
      "text": "（都筑先生把料理相关的事情都记住了吗。\n……我应该多向他交代一些的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1167714f3f782637d12d56286c2cbc98d5c7cc8ee812060396b41de655a4d73",
      "text": "（好，这里由我去吧。\n只留都筑先生一个人让人放心不下……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1858035959463aee793a7fb88052a5dcbffc7dfab51ff2ff9c910d3c29dadb2",
      "text": "不好意思！饮品的种类好多，\n请问有什么推荐的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ecfb6c8d457a0563a5d926b3ebb5f75aa698b219c5161a6fa232037c7613b9d",
      "text": "好、好的。请稍等片刻。\n今天的推荐是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000129:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7255370aab2488af239f90056754e18d8fc5080c60b8f9a19f76fc347cec96ea",
      "text": "（结果完全没能帮上都筑先生的忙……\n看来是我多虑了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:633f938b94083af7d9dd47f9d288df902bcb4041d9e35356bff426cd4b900f29",
      "text": "都筑先生。我刚才听到您的说明了。\n讲得非常精彩……坦白说让我大吃一惊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:664cd9842d5615a6da3a8819fb5f155dad0dda39c399861a221eb9fe9c48d442",
      "text": "……在和Cafe Parade的大家的练习中，\n我意识到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:808f198dd6937937cdc8c6ac5f173a536b550a499f2d343215048b9bf6a5fa55",
      "text": "能够注入自己的心意……注入感谢之情的\n料理，是多么美妙的作品啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cba92f036d5494b5a3526d5b0f70c2b2804995dc3eebe01d54c67986a379089",
      "text": "于是我就变得更想去了解他们的作品了……\n虽然只是按照我自己的方式学习了一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30a16f00935976eade6996db9245b768486e9506abd0e9361e11571491f1d9c5",
      "text": "我多多少少，有帮上感谢祭的忙吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45075c8631afba3e73860eb751a66518f1285d2e211c0cf4500ba41360f15aee",
      "text": "嗯！正是多亏了都筑先生的解说，\n料理肯定变得更加美味了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000181:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:150bb1a6a5584f6d62b7e923159a6f4b973ed12cdea6dfe8f193daa238355fa1",
      "text": "呵呵，能这样就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9a9fc9228e5cc694eb722aa57f947dbc3bcd0280c41399bcac4644f73b4b0fd",
      "text": "啊，您能喜欢真是再好不过了。\n其实这道茶，正是本店最为推荐的调配茶……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e116602d321310ab73866cb987037b56ef7bf39529a7beb3518c55b2e8b7901b",
      "text": "（大家都在笑着享受呢。\n能举办感谢祭真是太好了。……话说回来）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07759e4355daebe398f5d57d7383fa2b9e644860cc5253828cedc195f5576250",
      "text": "（是因为信的那件事吗。\n和粉丝们在一起的时候）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebd74ba78a3eee3bd906b51839f7a6c66c8994ae352bebe38d36f7378ee82316",
      "text": "（总会忍不住想起，\n无法像这样相互理解的家人……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:120a2e6693effcfbabf751be9c7bc4889dba7b19e1a7f97df5931741ecc945e3",
      "text": "（……有朝一日，吾也能有时间与同族\n如此促膝长谈吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cba5fa232f76a0dc3dee6c6961228670b1db17f351cd2a85fe95559cf3f2422",
      "text": "（想走上西点之路……我这样的梦想，\n会有得到认可的那一天吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9fd926022f18cd46b02fdd01592bd95d0330e20e1b2b1399409486d70cce788",
      "text": "（关于我真正喜欢的东西，\n能好好聊一聊的那一天会到来吗……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a94054bf29cc117866778dda901dda20996c906f3c8c3d83fc0d98058830cfd",
      "text": "（不行不行。马上就要到Live的时间了。\n现在必须全力以赴让客人们尽兴才行！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000122:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f0e92f217f01dba89d0ea4719b7028cb261b452bfd173bc21008220bdd6c26",
      "text": "Live结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9df2b1fadc1b406253657694562b561592ec56ce497462a932a7d8807cffcff5",
      "text": "……Live大获成功呢！\n大家都在笑着为我们应援。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ae1571c5f11647edd319d3caf162efa214199b6aad0e64544ae2133a5714972",
      "text": "唔！吾等的咏唱，\n竟能让他们如此欣喜……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f12d3f123947e68cf91b86158217273b31a65c75fd3f4eb11a5c4342b61c33a",
      "text": "……我啊，站在舞台上之后，\n重新意识到了一件事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395f7082b97b37c994947c703c88771c979abafbf4fcc17247426afaaa76fd55",
      "text": "Cafe Parade是能让我们保持自我、展现本色的\n另一个容身之所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97bd44c8f3543bb247f8e260d9a2541ae1f1d569eb51089c0c75ab9975a7defa",
      "text": "还有就是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:897944517336f28e37ae8758042bdf0738e8cc573cc193ab027f3f1f6c6d0761",
      "text": "汇聚了这样的我们的Cafe Parade，\n拥有让人感到幸福的力量！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000198:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a45e737cefdcceeaa6c65170706f22f238027916c3a764c81f05f91c68cc7384",
      "text": "……啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000219:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bec5451b9231aa25bb3e6907f3a1b29f64af6eedb97dd5c9de99dc63ce18b58a",
      "text": "（我也许依然还是那个任性的小孩……\n但是）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000223:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4eef2ca436091eecfc8003e44de4faaac1cb57617a84940d9b961ddae554b6d",
      "text": "（从Cafe Parade将幸福传递给全世界。\n我想继续追逐属于自己的这份梦想……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000244:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d6af8bb6daebacbdd25cd1751ef49a3affd71f461e2c3df0d84baf1199c3dfd",
      "text": "……咲酱，我也是这么想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000252:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43452183f453bb4987204b206d6adda3cbd9363fe01137d4946f94eae9e59b8a",
      "text": "今后也一起创造出\n更多的笑容与幸福吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_i:cmd-000023:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae6ac9d2aa2c7e26aad1c5fe2d2fb5266c1f75589a9ab33b9a18205f7f9c04b3",
      "text": "感谢祭结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3492a7fdb30f36a3c612d6ab1b77da938d58fd33a8c735e51e564648db940c1",
      "text": "大家今天辛苦了。\n感谢祭大获成功呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_i:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d43a79b19dc48867c7dbcc7bf129edb0a07f3f62f04e3d4f2b6d293daf4fee4f",
      "text": "是的！离开的客人们每个人都带着笑容……\n我也感到很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22673ba917db3f3a317c1cff1bbeaa2abbeec233011b42ebb489d9f818b4ff19",
      "text": "今后，吾等在光之民面前现身的机会亦会\n增多。期待再度相见之日！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_i:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:857f3fabecad7ca5e9386c26ca362ae3c6e0345a3d6b6dcc88fcdf3c1fc85675",
      "text": "为了能和更多的客人相遇，\n大家一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2f1afbcb394e3b37ecabe365aa24e0420cb23b50b73f0662f076eb7a49a83cd",
      "text": "说起来今天，我从一位和父母同来的\n粉丝那里，听到了令人高兴的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:336ea3223241df882b1e9370286e712e1597c1f126e819f84ac9113c97abb7e5",
      "text": "据说一开始父母还觉得“女儿迷上偶像真让人担心”，\n心存顾虑……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_i:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8709895b097051a4a1d86e1967c759bc60801890360b935106eada100e9f1935",
      "text": "但在亲眼目睹了我们的款待之后，\n那份担忧也消散了。不过嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_i:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dab5d7b4461c299e6b0356983b3bf3619c5ba4f24782dd652f8d5b7f2c6a1214",
      "text": "他们也笑着说“就算这样偶尔还是会担心呢”，\n但肯定没问题了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46a9e431ab3717f9ec8302f0ca64dcf2a3d355d7f473523b33486798a979cddd",
      "text": "听到父母这番话，那位粉丝还\n无奈地说自己明明都二十岁了，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91e67315c6b13f21f11b04fe333a8ab88be9f502e9da5d023e4bd1c8df76a322",
      "text": "不过这大概就是常说的“在父母眼里，孩子永远都是孩子”\n吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a4f10cfabf2a6233fe75517e42b7f50dca23041cfcb4666ee57306655d2bf04",
      "text": "……这样啊，既然如此。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_i:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1c94397ff1069972870ff9bfbafa9954a58f134a38f109c2d4406452004480b",
      "text": "呐，东云。就算我们依然还是孩子气，\n或许也不是什么坏事呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_i:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3d44ac11bf4b9ac75c6c4d4b7b51dae88e6056ace4bbf1ebd4c5275ed302eff",
      "text": "呵呵，也许是这样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f9830173e98b5bea51ec0db7c6375e3ae708590c06a2285525d363e93c8274c",
      "text": "……那个，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6318036999ca5f71304f42d50cf9c59be0b407bbfb2a658bcd36b73a7e484117",
      "text": "我们作为偶像、作为人，\n或许都还很不成熟……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34cf1e95dbedc008ed36a97ae0a3cb8216c00d9992e873398e92141b8739b5f1",
      "text": "但今后要是能继续\n帮助我们成长，我会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:792b84b06c9260771fe176d73a82869c632f3a98165f074d8c3437de874ef093",
      "text": "只要有制作人在，\n我们一定能够跨越任何艰难险阻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c61502ccc3cfdcd689d113cdae85437734327bfbc0318b0b5017a442a30a0d4",
      "text": "嗯，那是当然。\n今后也一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000086:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25de8bbbf449b97bdf6b5afc380d1701af5ebe5832b8ef846b86b8b0845ae798",
      "text": "真怀念啊，这封信。\n没想到真的能找出来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8855456b5f7ecf5765bda75a907b6e14ea1f39ccf5d385cb8522bd13c7228c6",
      "text": "（……“在父母眼里，孩子永远都是孩子”吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bbf4a1a3eb4f1a12bac11bffeb0c3fa7c16010de9186a04bdeb6cd0fc4930fa",
      "text": "（反过来肯定也是一样的吧。\n对孩子来说，父母是无可替代的存在）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0014c996530adaec15f29c3c9667fa620f855fa66e16787094b27aac31975bcf",
      "text": "（正因如此，我才会如此强烈地希望\n他们能够理解我吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:949c14f270b62ef5c2f7aa498af1a66dccde381e34d985d28b0370e4e6e582a2",
      "text": "“明明希望你们能够更多地理解我”……嗯？\n后面的内容空白了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d9d83063eca8b9021b31e3ce442cf28509f6516395a31a6032b0f52deca9648",
      "text": "（是因为觉得反正也不会被理解，\n中途就放弃写下去了吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2aac0f7c740fb75cd73a4185b246877fc70ac1e80a4fc8ca5f5b9ec0191db2fd",
      "text": "……好。就由现在的我来续写下去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76d99eb3004fda106f07677db562b2d4a390e4226c5d824ea23ef64cb0251495",
      "text": "“希望你们能更多地理解我……\n不，有朝一日我一定会让你们理解的！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00963c674d4f164e6a379d93391eebc29ee680d0c5b12887cd755aba9ebf18e0",
      "text": "“成长为足够优秀、能让你们认可的模样，\n更加茁壮地成长……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f549a367bd50b804751589d5192a7d8f67add32d0b38120180ff6ef615eeb57",
      "text": "（……对。为了那终将到来的时刻。\n我要在这里，好好展现自己的成长给你们看）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
